"""A partial approximation using adjacent quantifier and size constructions.

The large, predictable signals are local combinations, not a general topic:
`the only/specified`, `both of`, and completions of words such as `big`.
It also handles a few fixed size-prefix compounds, test annotations,
repeated middle-dot leaders, and initial level-two Markdown markers.
Most other positions are left near zero. Numbers below are approximate
activation sizes, not probabilities. Document boundaries reset the context.
Lexical and longer-context variation outside these rules is not modeled.
